      {
        "id": 253797,
        "name": "William Kolar",
        "username": "SirMetaKnight",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/91b2a8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2023-08-26T20:53:27.413Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually did some similar to this, but since DC Supervillains holds my OCs, I did it in Lego Marvel Superheroes 2. I might add screenshots eventually, but for now, I made Legacy, Baron Blade, Expatriate, Chrono-Ranger (even though he was based off Time-Slinger, Chrono-Ranger is a way better name), Citizen Dawn, and K.N.Y.F.E… I’m working on Sergeant Steel (since Bigfigs aren’t in the character creator) and 2 are reserved, but for my last one I could do La Capitan or a suggestion.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-08-26T20:53:27.413Z",
