        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I actually did some similar to this, but since DC Supervillains holds my OCs, I did it in Lego Marvel Superheroes 2. I might add screenshots eventually, but for now, I made Legacy, Baron Blade, Expatriate, Chrono-Ranger (even though he was based off Time-Slinger, Chrono-Ranger is a way better name), Citizen Dawn, and K.N.Y.F.E.. I'm working on Sergeant Steel (since Bigfigs aren't in the character creator) and 2 are reserved, but for my last one I could do La Capitan or a suggestion.",
